    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἱρκτή</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρκ-</span></b> , 
